From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: owner <owner@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:25:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 06/11] Taviri: item icons in the app family style

A text custom field `taviri:icon` picks an item's icon: an id from the
Taviri icon pack (the owner's app family icons plus glyphs for vault
items, shipped as PNG data URLs), a website to borrow its icon, or none.
A branded build gives items without a website icon their type's pack
icon and shows it while a website icon loads or when the site has none
(popup and inline menu). `taviri:` fields are never typed into pages.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
